# Android bootstrap (code, 2026-08-17)

`AndroidAgentBootstrapService.bootstrap` (`bootstrap.py`): detect → API≥26 → Gradle `:app:assembleDebug` **and** `:automation:assembleDebug` (reuse stamp if input SHA matches) → inspect/install → runtime grants → special access → start loopback `:38471` → handshake.

`force_reinstall=True` → `InstallAction.UPDATE` even when hashes match (`adb install -r`). Agent APK does **not** use `-t`. OEM `--no-streaming` for Xiaomi/OPPO/vivo or API≤28.

Handshake `AgentHandshakeCoordinator.negotiate` calls `client.bootstrap(session_id, api_version)` **without** selection policy. Policy bootstrap happens later in `Phase7AndroidAgentRunner.acquire`.

## Special access — QUICK and FULL are identical

`special_access_for_inventory_mode`: required `(ACCESSIBILITY,)`; optional `(MANAGE_ALL_FILES, NOTIFICATION_LISTENER)`.

| Kind | Wait | Fail |
|---|---|---|
| Accessibility | Settings + poll 180s; try `restore_accessibility_service` first | **Abort** |
| Semua file (`MANAGE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE`) | Open all-files screen; message `Menunggu izin Semua file pada perangkat` | **Fail-soft** — continue without documents |
| Notification listener | ADB `allow_listener` only (must not open Settings) | Fail-soft |

Runtime photo/video required (API 33+ `READ_MEDIA_*`); SMS/contacts optional. Required runtime timeout **aborts**.

`document_grant_id` is always `None`. All-files unlocks `shared_storage_document`. `document_tree` becomes `document_tree_not_required` once all-files is granted; SAF is unused on this path.

## Automation install

`AndroidUiAutomationOrchestrator.run` reinstalls automation APK with `allow_test_packages=True` (`-t`) before each social run. After instrumentation: restore Accessibility, `_restart_agent`, then runner **re-`client.bootstrap` with selection policy** before `report_automation_result`. Host timeout 250s; navigation deadline 240s.

Teardown: stop agent, remove forward, wipe token. Also on token expiry and `_run_pipeline` `finally`.
